 the\nworker browser context on all retry-ladder attempts. A manual\nmain-
 chat rerun recovered the day's levels\, and the premarket\npost in the 
 locked format was published and verified on all\nfive channels. The same 
 morning\, both onlyspx scheduled jobs\nwere converted to main-chat 
 execution after the session split\nbetween worker and main-chat browser 
 contexts was confirmed.
