 wall.\nThe gap was computed in the codespace\, the exact draft was\nshown 
 first and approved\, and the text post was published and\nverified on the 
 three text channels\, including the 5-Day Gap\nStatus section. The gap 
 graphic was then published on the two\nimage channels\, completing the 
 day's full onlyspx set.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
