 holds no repositories and the new org holds all of\nthem. Codespaces was 
 enabled for the new org\, a replacement\ncoding workspace was created on 
 the notebook mirror repo\,\nthe data API key was confirmed present (it 
 transferred with\nthe repo)\, and a full notebook verification run 
