  never-write rule applies\nto passwords and login credentials. Two 
 standing rules were\nrecorded from his words. The automation API was 
 then\nconnected through the secure vault by the owner and verified\nlive 
 twice\, with a helper built so sessions can be created\nand monitored by 
 API. A draft record for the key was in\nprogress at wrap time and is not 
 yet confirmed.
