UID:7f6a5620-f5eb-4cd0-a69b-0422299c6ec8@7f6a.org
DESCRIPTION:Root cause found on the host: the booking app has no\nlegacy 
 booking route at all\; its real path differs\, while\nthe admin display 
 still shows the legacy links. The owner\nchose the redirect fix. A server 
 redirect was applied and\nverified live: every legacy booking link now 
 lands on its\ncorrect booking page\, including a special case for 
 the\nrenamed original\, and the native links and admin still\nwork. The 
 server was reloaded\, not restarted\, and nothing\nelse on the host 
 changed. The hosting account identity was\nverified and recorded in the 
 account map\, and a full\nend-to-end runbook covering the diagnosis\, fix 
 and\nrollback was written and pushed at the owner's request.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
