 verified live
UID:b512480c-e99d-4c81-b110-bb976160b722@b512.org
DESCRIPTION:Research on porting the pivot and gap method to Bitcoin\nwas 
 completed and its recommendation accepted by the\nowner: anchor to the 
 exchange session settlement\, take the\nexpected move from a public 
 volatility index\, and redefine\nthe gap leg\, since the futures market 
 now trades around\nthe clock and the old weekend gap no longer forms. 
 A\ndedicated notebook mirroring the existing market notebook\nwas built 
 and pushed\, then verified in timed live runs:\nthe settlement field is 
 carried by the data feed\, a\nfirst gap study was measured on the 
 instrument's own\nhistory\, weekend sessions are constructed from spot 
 and\nlabelled\, and a persistence layer keeps the daily run\nfast. Whether
  the run goes on a daily timer or stays\nmanual is the owner's pending 
 decision.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
