 (numbers ship only from downloaded run-output files)\, an independent 
 recomputation checker with cross-file and freshness checks wired as a hard
  gate into all four scheduled runs\, and per-run archives. An external 
 model was consulted on the design. End-to-end test on fresh productions 
 passed every check.
