UID:88290b21-a2be-4e5c-a1de-161d2623f437@8829.org
DESCRIPTION:An independent engine was consulted on preserving the 
 full\nchat history from day one. Its recommendation matched the\nagent's 
 on every main point: keep all messages verbatim in\ndual formats\, the 
 local database as source of truth\, the\nprivate repository as the 
 versioned archive and a Drive\nmirror\, with a one-time backfill and count
  verification.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
