 the\nday's verified pivots and gap were posted in strict order:\nemini 
 apology and pivots completed on the social and forum\nchannels\, Bitcoin 
 apology\, pivots and gap completed on three\nchannels\, and the day's gap 
 completed on all six channels\,\nevery post read back. On one channel 
 image attachment is not\navailable to automation\, so the emini apology 
 went out\ntext-only by the owner's own post and the remaining image\nposts
  were staged for his attach clicks\, still unverified at\nwrap time. A 
 text-only canon breach on two Bitcoin posts was\ncaught by the owner and 
 fixed the same day (see next entry).
