 post\nchannels against the per-channel token canon. Production 
 posts\nmatched\; the deviations found were all in hand-handled one-
 off\nitems from before the emitter era. A parallel check confirmed\nthe 
 forum channel has no working token system for replies\, so\nits token-free
  format loses nothing. The owner directed that\nthe deviating posts be 
 left exactly as they are.
