UID:531f236e-e9f9-4ed3-aa4b-6f6cdf8d21b5@531f.org
DESCRIPTION:Fixed the root cause of the token deviations: the 
 Bitcoin\nemitter now generates the same per-channel post files from 
 the\nsealed run bundle that the emini runs already emitted\, the\ntoken 
 canon is written in one file\, and all four production\njob bodies now 
 require the token line to be read back from\nthe live post and quoted to 
 the owner before a post counts\nas complete. Hand-composed post texts are 
 retired.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
