 verified\nlive - pins\, dossiers\, radius and field-radar 
 features\,\nquick filters\, import and export\, the second map 
 engine\nafter a referrer domain was added to the dedicated key\,\nand a 
 geocoding fix that verified the full pin set. A\nbackup copy was made\, a 
 frontier-model review returned a\ngraded list of findings\, and the owner 
 directed that all\nof them be applied in guided\, audited group 
 rounds\,\nwhich was done\, with the live-verified and code-only\nresults 
 reported separately. The app still runs a\nsynthetic dataset and a model-
 made logo\; the real\ndataset goes in through the owner or the app's 
 new\npaste-in import.
