 approved by the owner and fully\nimplemented the same afternoon: weekday 
 settlements\ncome only from the session bar's own settlement 
 field\,\nretried inside the run and then the run blocks\, with\nno close-
 proxy or snapshot fallback\; the gap run reads\nonly the settlement the 
 pivots locked in\; the session\ncutoff was fixed\; a cache guard prevents 
 a\nsettlement-less fresh row overwriting a cached row\nthat has one\; and 
 the pivots schedule moved later in\nthe evening\, with the calendar's 
 recurring event\nupdated to match. One basis-distortion observation 
 was\nleft inspection-only\, with no fix prescribed. A saved\ncredential 
 that was rejected during the sign-in was\nreported to the owner in the 
 moment\, and updating it\nremains an open item.
