UID:da933aae-2462-4e78-827a-0d76bb4f54c7@da93.org
DESCRIPTION:Inbound mail for one domain was confirmed down at the\nDNS 
 layer: its zones sit in a cloud account suspended\nthe previous 
 afternoon\, minutes after the last mail\narrived\, while sending still 
 works. The mailbox\nprovider account was verified directly as active 
 and\npaid\, and its console flags the mail records as missing\nonly 
 because it reads the unserved DNS. Moving the DNS\nto the provider that 
 already serves the other domain\nwas presented as an option\; the owner 
 paused the\ndecision and nothing was changed.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
