 two\nquantities behind a remembered radius term: an\nexit-side distance 
 from the intended market to the\nwitnessed exit location\, judged against 
 configured\ncity and region radii\, and an incoming-side timing\nbound 
 whose final determination rejected it as proof\nof location. One proposed 
 mechanism is genuinely\ndocumented in the project's records\; the other 
 appears\nonly as false positives. A final follow-up question\nremains 
 outstanding.
