 found\, in the sites' own analytics\,\na one-day surge of automated 
 sessions on the chat\npages from an overseas datacentre\, with 
 no\nengagement. The search indexing work was ruled out\nby the search 
 provider's own crawl counts\, the\nlowest in two weeks that day. Naming 
 the visitor\nstill requires the old account's logs\, held by 
