  rounds with the coding reviewer:\nthe response was restructured to fit 
 the client's\nposted budget by reducing depth\, real prior audits\nwere 
 refurbished into finished\, method-redacted\nsample outputs\, and a claim 
 audit was built with\nthe draft and then rebuilt for the 
 restructured\nbid\, with every claim grounded directly or\nindirectly and 
 none ungrounded. Nothing was sent\nat that stage.
