SUMMARY:Proposal form mechanics verified live\; contract-basis 
 contradiction surfaced
UID:ce59752a-c066-477d-906a-025ddebf70d1@ce59.org
DESCRIPTION:A read-only live test of the actual proposal form\nverified the
  cover-letter character limit\, the\nattachment allowance\, and that the 
 client's\nquestions travel inside the letter. It also\nsurfaced an 
 unresolved contradiction: the scraped\nask recorded a fixed-price budget 
 while the live\nform presented an hourly job. No text was changed\nfor 
 it\, nothing was submitted\, and no credits\nwere spent.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261107T105700
