 established
UID:48941e69-54fc-4cdc-86e9-bc76c25c3d52@4894.org
DESCRIPTION:At the owner's correction\, the pair self-audited\nthe process 
 actually used to create the first bid\,\nusing the chat transcript as 
 evidence. The audit\nreplaced an earlier asserted draft with an 
 audited\nstep format: open exploration first\, form limits\nonly at the 
 focused finish\, live-ask and form\nverification before drafting\, and 
 claim audits\nbuilt with the first draft. Drafting authority and\nowner-
 only gates were recorded as standing rules.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
