DESCRIPTION:A strategic audit of all captured leads was built\nwith the 
 coding reviewer under the adopted\nreasoning instructions. A lead 
 qualifies only when\nfit\, a viable purchase at the live budget\, 
 honest\nproof\, a ready draft and a closable gate all hold\nat once. Most 
 observable asks differed from the\nearlier sweep records\, so live asks 
 govern ranking.\nA small first priority batch and two 
 conditional\nexperiments were set out\; the rest were held with\nreasons 
 and one was excluded. Nothing was sent.
DTSTAMP:20261108T172913Z
END:VEVENT
